{"30775":[{"footnoteId":11513,"paragraphs":[{"pid":11,"text":"Or, “elder.” Gr., pre·sbyʹte·ros."}]},{"footnoteId":11514,"paragraphs":[{"pid":12,"text":"Or, “I love in the truth.”"}]}],"30776":[{"footnoteId":11515,"paragraphs":[{"pid":13,"text":"Lit., “to make one’s way well.”"}]}],"30777":[{"footnoteId":11516,"paragraphs":[{"pid":14,"text":"Lit., “excessively.”"}]},{"footnoteId":11517,"paragraphs":[{"pid":15,"text":"“Came.” Gr., er·kho·meʹnon, referring to a past coming."}]}],"30780":[{"footnoteId":11518,"paragraphs":[{"pid":16,"text":"Or, “you will do well to.”"}]}],"30781":[{"footnoteId":11519,"paragraphs":[{"pid":17,"text":"Or, “the.”"}]}],"30782":[{"footnoteId":11520,"paragraphs":[{"pid":18,"text":"Or, “become workers with the truth.”"}]}],"30783":[{"footnoteId":11521,"paragraphs":[{"pid":19,"text":"Lit., “the (one) liking to be first.”"}]}],"30784":[{"footnoteId":11522,"paragraphs":[{"pid":20,"text":"Lit., “not being satisfied.”"}]},{"footnoteId":11523,"paragraphs":[{"pid":21,"text":"Or, “continues; makes it his practice.”"}]}],"30787":[{"footnoteId":11524,"paragraphs":[{"pid":22,"text":"Lit., “reed.”"}]}],"30788":[{"footnoteId":11525,"paragraphs":[{"pid":23,"text":"Lit., “mouth toward mouth.”"}]}]}